---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---
<Layout
  title="About"
  description="What TechWeUse is and how we actually research what we cover."
>
  <h1>About TechWeUse</h1>
  <p>
    TechWeUse covers software, productivity tools, and the digital side of
    gaming — subscriptions, platforms, and apps we dig into properly
    before writing about them.
  </p>
  <p>
    Where we can genuinely get hands-on with something, we do. Where
    that's not possible — some software needs specific hardware or setups
    we don't have access to — we rely on documented evidence instead:
    official policies, independent test results, and verified user
    reports, not marketing copy. We're upfront in each piece about which
    kind of research backs it, and we don't recommend anything we
    wouldn't trust ourselves.
  </p>
</Layout>
